    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You grew up close to the land. Years spent caring for animals and working the soil gave you patience and robust health. You value the gifts of nature, and you have a healthy respect for its fury.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Strength, Constitution, Wisdom</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.LUeMriAibyVJHhaW]{Tough}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Animal Handling and Nature</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulCarpenters]{Carpenter's Tools}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepSickle0000]{Sickle}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulCarpenters]{Carpenter's Tools}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagHealersKit0]{Healer's Kit}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPotIron0000]{Iron Pot}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagShovel00000]{Shovel}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 30 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
